  "text": "French 75\n\nIngredients\n\n2 parts gin,\n\n1 part lime juice,\n\n1 part sugar syrup,\n\nChampagne.\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Add the ingredients to a champagne glass and top up with champagne.",
